{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Entails.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.elimTopPre\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">elimTopPre</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">goal</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.VCGenM\">VCGenM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Reduce a `Prop`-lattice goal `(⊤ : Prop) ⊑ φ` to the bare proposition `φ` via `top_le_prop`,\nreturning any other goal unchanged. The match on `Sort 0` keeps it to the `Prop` base lattice,\nwhere the reduction is sound; entailments at an abstract lattice carrier pass through.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Entails.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.elimTopPre","kind":"def","line":248,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.elimTopPre","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Entails.lean#L248-L257"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Entails.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.reduceTopAppliedPre?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">reduceTopAppliedPre?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">goal</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">target </span><span class=\"fn\">pre</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM\">Meta.Sym.SymM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Reduce a precondition that is the bare top applied to the state arguments introduced by\n`le_of_forall_le`, `(⊤ : σ₁ → … → σₙ → Prop) s₁ … sₙ`, to the bare `(⊤ : Prop)`, rewriting `goal`'s\ntarget `pre ⊑ rhs` to `⊤ ⊑ rhs`. The equation `pre = ⊤` is built on demand by folding\n`Lean.Order.top_apply` over the excess arguments and applied with `replaceTargetEq`.\n\nThe proof term is built directly with `mkApp`/`mkConst` and instances extracted from `pre`, avoiding\n`mkAppM`/instance synthesis (both expensive and unable to unify `max`-of-universe-variable instance\nlevels in the abstract-monad setting). Returns `none` if `pre` is not the bare top applied to ≥ 1\nargument, or its lattice instances are not in the expected `instCompleteLatticePi` shape (the caller\nthen falls through).","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Entails.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.reduceTopAppliedPre?","kind":"def","line":194,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.reduceTopAppliedPre?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Entails.lean#L194-L246"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Entails.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.splitForallLe?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">splitForallLe?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">goal</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">rhs</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.VCGenM\">VCGenM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Decompose a `∀`/`→` on the RHS of `pre ⊑ (∀ x, q x)` via `le_forall`.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Entails.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.splitForallLe?","kind":"def","line":186,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.splitForallLe?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Entails.lean#L186-L192"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Entails.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.splitLatticeOp?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">splitLatticeOp?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">goal</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">rhs</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.VCGenM\">VCGenM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Decompose the head of the RHS of `pre ⊑ rhs` with its split in `latticeOps` or a registered\n`@[frameproc]` operator: saturate it with the split's rewrites, close it with its terminal, and\nbuild a frame for any excess state arguments. Returns `none` if no split applies.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Entails.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.splitLatticeOp?","kind":"def","line":169,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.splitLatticeOp?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Entails.lean#L169-L184"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Entails.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.introPre\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">introPre</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">rule</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Apply.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.BackwardRule\">Meta.Sym.BackwardRule</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">goal</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.VCGenM\">VCGenM</a> (<a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.FVarId\">FVarId</a></span>)</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Apply precondition-intro rule `rule` to `goal`, then introduce the freed hypothesis,\nleaving `⊤` as the residual precondition. Returns the new goal and the last introduced hypothesis,\nor `none` when every conjunct is an equation that `substEqHyp?` leaves unused.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Entails.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.introPre","kind":"def","line":123,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.introPre","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Entails.lean#L123-L149"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Entails.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.unfoldTriple\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">unfoldTriple</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">goal</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.VCGenM\">VCGenM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Unfold `⦃P⦄ x ⦃Q; E⦄` into the underlying entailment `P ⊑ wp x Q E`.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Entails.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.unfoldTriple","kind":"def","line":36,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.unfoldTriple","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Entails.lean#L36-L40"}}],"imports":["Init.Sym.Lemmas","Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context","Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.RuleCache","Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Util","Lean.Meta.Sym.AbstractS","Lean.Meta.Sym.InferType","Lean.Meta.Sym.InstantiateMVarsS","Lean.Meta.Sym.InstantiateS","Lean.Meta.Sym.MaxFVar","Lean.Meta.Sym.Util","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Replace","Std.WP"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Entails"}